{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫即將開拍權謀題材的古裝劇集《掌心雪》，滕麗名、高海寧、陳曉華、王敏奕、郭柏妍及蔣祖曼下月將前往橫店取景拍攝。</p><p>除了滕麗名外，眾女皆是首次拍攝古裝劇，坦言要向她請教！</p><p>上述組合大部分是人氣劇集《新聞女王》班底，目前《新聞女王III》仍在籌備中</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T16:24:24.690083+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T16:00:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T16:17:34.987552+00:00","content_hash":"8a0f381b6a9024194db93696db828bc3d6b1467ab76ddf452a09161cd3418936","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}